# V1 Project Structure Guide

This is a **Turborepo monorepo** SaaS starter kit based on Midday.ai patterns.

## 🏗️ **Core Architecture**

```
v1/
├── apps/                    # Applications
│   ├── api/                 # Supabase (Auth, DB, Storage, Edge Functions)
│   ├── app/                 # Main SaaS product (Next.js)
│   └── web/                 # Marketing website (Next.js)
├── packages/                # Shared packages
│   ├── ui/                  # Shadcn/ui components
│   ├── supabase/           # Database client & types
│   ├── analytics/          # OpenPanel analytics
│   ├── email/              # React Email templates
│   ├── jobs/               # Trigger.dev background jobs
│   ├── kv/                 # Upstash Redis & rate limiting
│   └── logger/             # Logging utilities
└── tooling/                # Build & config tools
    └── typescript/         # Shared TS configs
```

## 📦 **Package References**

Always use workspace aliases when importing:
- `@v1/ui` - UI components from [packages/ui](mdc:packages/ui)
- `@v1/supabase` - Database from [packages/supabase](mdc:packages/supabase)
- `@v1/analytics` - Analytics from [packages/analytics](mdc:packages/analytics)
- `@v1/kv` - Redis & rate limiting from [packages/kv](mdc:packages/kv)
- `@v1/logger` - Logging from [packages/logger](mdc:packages/logger)
- `@v1/email` - Email templates from [packages/email](mdc:packages/email)
- `@v1/jobs` - Background jobs from [packages/jobs](mdc:packages/jobs)

## 🎯 **Key Entry Points**

- **Main App**: [apps/app/src/app](mdc:apps/app/src/app) - SaaS product
- **Marketing**: [apps/web/src/app](mdc:apps/web/src/app) - Public website  
- **Database**: [apps/api/supabase](mdc:apps/api/supabase) - Supabase config
- **UI Components**: [packages/ui/src/components](mdc:packages/ui/src/components)
- **Actions**: [apps/app/src/actions](mdc:apps/app/src/actions) - Server Actions
- **DB Types**: [packages/supabase/src/types/db.ts](mdc:packages/supabase/src/types/db.ts)

## 🛠️ **Development Commands**

- `bun dev` - Start all apps in parallel
- `bun dev:app` - Start main SaaS app only  
- `bun dev:web` - Start marketing site only
- `bun build` - Build all apps
- `bun lint` - Lint with Biome
- `bun typecheck` - TypeScript checking
